{"id":434,"gn":"Pokémon Moufette","ft":["Son derrière propulse un fluide nauséabond qui peut faire fuir les Pokémon dans un rayon de 2 km.","Il se protège en expulsant un fluide nocif par son derrière. La puanteur dure 24 heures.","Il propulse un liquide extrêmement nauséabond au visage de son adversaire depuis son derrière. Il peut atteindre une cible à cinq mètres.","S’il lève la queue, c’est qu’il s’apprête à projeter un liquide tellement nauséabond qu’il peut faire perdre connaissance."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":0,"24":1,"25":0,"26":1,"33":2,"34":3},"gr":4,"cr":225,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Terrestre"],"gw":"medium","gm":{"sv":[0,226],"la":[0,110],"bdsp":[0,84],"sw":[0,130],"xy":[1,102],"pt":[0,84],"dp":[0,84]},"f":{"434":{"n":"Moufouette","t":["poison","dark"],"s":[63,63,47,41,41,74],"h":0.4,"w":19.2,"a":[[1,0],[106,0],[51,1]],"pa":[[4,[[1,0],[106,0]]]],"av":["sv","la","bdsp","sw","xy","pt","dp"],"hi":[[128,5,[12,13,14,15,16,17,18,21,22]]],"ls":[{"l":[[10,1],[139,1],[364,3],[108,6],[491,9],[154,12],[116,15],[44,18],[474,21],[103,24],[92,27],[389,30],[262,33],[400,36],[562,39],[153,42]],"m":[34,36,38,46,53,91,92,114,126,129,156,164,168,182,184,188,203,214,240,241,242,247,263,269,270,282,342,390,398,399,417,421,441,474,482,491,492,506,555,583,675,808,851,885,915],"e":[38,43,114,123,163,310]},{"l":[[33,1],[491,6],[139,11],[474,18],[400,25],[398,34],[38,43]]},{"l":[[139,1],[10,1],[364,3],[108,6],[491,9],[154,12],[116,15],[44,18],[474,21],[103,24],[92,27],[389,30],[262,33],[400,36],[562,39],[599,42],[153,45]],"m":[15,46,53,91,92,104,126,153,156,164,168,182,188,203,207,213,214,231,240,241,247,249,259,263,269,371,399,417,421,432,555],"e":[38,43,114,123,163,184,242,310,492,583]},{"l":[[139,1],[10,1],[364,3],[108,6],[491,9],[154,12],[116,15],[44,18],[474,21],[103,24],[92,27],[389,30],[262,33],[400,36],[562,39],[599,42],[153,45]],"m":[53,91,103,116,126,129,156,164,168,173,182,184,188,203,213,214,231,240,241,242,247,263,269,371,372,399,417,421,474,492,496,506,541,555,583,599